  "question": "A bullet is fired from a gun at the speed of $280\\ \\text{m s}^{-1}$ in the direction $30°$ above the horizontal. The maximum height attained by the bullet is ($g = 9.8\\ \\text{m s}^{-2}$, $\\sin 30° = 0.5$) :",
