  "answer": "C",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$H = \\frac{u^2\\sin^2\\theta}{2g} = \\frac{280^2 \\times 0.25}{2 \\times 9.8} = \\frac{19600}{19.6} = 1000\\ \\text{m}$$",
